'''Aoshi Shinomori''' (四乃森蒼紫, ''Shinomori Aoshi'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy from the [[Rurouni Kenshin Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 13.4 Update|Version 13.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Aoshi Shinomori
|image = E 690.png
|first appearance = [[Rurouni Kenshin Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,500¢ - 5,925¢
}}

==Enemy==
Aoshi is an LD unit who is quite weak to units that get into his blindspot. However, he is often backed by enemies who can cover, and his high range can reach [[Crazed Bahamut Cat]]. The ability to freeze makes it harder to get into his blindspot, and allows enemies to handle those in his blindspot.

==Strategy==
Rushers are the way to go. You need to blitz into his blind spot and take him out quick before his support fully kicks in. You can also lure him closer to your base, if his support is slow, and then rush him down. [[Crazed Giraffe Cat]] is a rather good rusher that can handle him.

